Subject: [PATCH] OrionLayer Open Fix 49: report the turn-time popups under
 their own ids and send what they show ("TPOP")

Ported onto orion2re v2.0.0 in scratch (work order 242 e) from local 6859e163:
renamed merge; colland.cpp placed whitespace-insensitively (v2 writes ::fields:: and added an occupation-policy block before the loop); turnsum.cpp by hand (v2 puts the brace of if (return_screen == SCREEN_REPORTS) on the same line; renamed g_turn_sum_header etc.).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
